  "displayName": "Railsstarter Engineering Wiki",
  "purpose": "Engineering knowledge base for the railsstarter Rails 8 application: architecture decisions, runbooks and deploy/ops playbooks, the infrastructure model (multi-database MySQL, Solid Queue/Cache/Cable, AWS ECS Fargate, CloudWatch, OpenTelemetry), and onboarding. It is the durable, git-native home for how this system is built and operated, queryable by both the team and agents.",
